    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's almost Christmas, and Ginger is looking for a recipe to the Best Roast Christmas Dinner the Zodiacs has ever seen!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;They will all scream for more and then nobody will try to eat me, no more no more!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >..but to get the recipe he'll have to enlist the help of his friend, <strong>Sullyvan the Salarylamb</strong>, if he wants to have any hope of making it to <strong>Santa's Factory</strong>. Join <strong>Ginger</strong>, <strong>Sullyvan</strong> and the mysterious <strong>Christmas Gonk</strong> as they travel the lengths of Capricorn's realm in search of <strong>Santa's Factory</strong> so they can deliver their letters, and <strong>Ginger</strong> can save himself from being eaten, again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ginger's Letter to Santa is a short Christmas story taking place in the Virgo Versus The Zodiac universe  after the events of the Cardinal Ending. Consider it a little Christmas present from us in the Moonana team to the fans of our first game on the 5 year anniversary of it's release!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392430/extras/664b7ac1f74ee029f6650b8e4e9be2ff.poster.avif?t=1734737603\" width=800 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392430/extras/664b7ac1f74ee029f6650b8e4e9be2ff.webm?t=1734737603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392430/extras/664b7ac1f74ee029f6650b8e4e9be2ff.mp4?t=1734737603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Christmas Spirit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Santa Clawse is real</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Child Labor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >..and Classic Turn Based Combat</p></li></ul>",
